OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few brighter spells across
OL,6,Fthe east, otherwise cloudy with
OL,7,Fscattered showers. Showers will be
OL,8,Fheavy at times with a chance of hail
OL,9,Fand thunder. Some longer spells of
OL,10,Frain possible in the north. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers becoming confined to
OL,13,Fthe north and west overnight. Becoming
OL,14,Fmainly dry across the east with clear
OL,15,Fperiods. Chilly in sheltered glens in
OL,16,Fthe east.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FStarting dry across the east.
OL,19,FOtherwise variable amounts of cloud
OL,20,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,21,Facross the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
