OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and fewer showers on Saturday.
OL,7,FMainly dry on Sunday, a few showers in
OL,8,Fthe north. Rain likely to spread
OL,9,Fnortheast on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
